  "slug": "hvac-rooftop-unit-vendor-sign-in-form",
  "title": "HVAC Rooftop Unit Vendor Access and Service Sign-In Record",
  "subtitle": "Control an HVAC vendor visit from authorization and personnel check-in through roof access, safety orientation, keys and badges, RTU work status, exceptions, departure reconciliation, and facility handoff.",
  "description": "A vendor accountability record designed for HVAC rooftop unit visits, including work-order authorization, personnel credentials, roof and electrical safety requirements, access-item custody, asset scope, change approval, work evidence, sign-out, and unresolved conditions.",
  "use_case": "Use when an outside HVAC contractor enters a facility or roof area to inspect, maintain, or repair RTUs and security, facilities, and the service company need one traceable record of who entered, what access was issued, what work was authorized, and how the site was left.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
